      "description": "Estados informativos sin interacción ni significado basado solo en color.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badges\"><span class=\"ds-badge ds-closed\">Cerrado</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-available\">Disponible</span><span class=\"ds-badge ds-pending\">Pendiente</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-badge{display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid;border-radius:9999px;padding:4px 12px;font:500 14px/20px system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif}.ds-closed{background:rgb(var(--surface-overlay,243 243 243));border-color:rgb(var(--surface-border,222 222 222));color:rgb(var(--muted,94 94 94))}.ds-available{background:rgba(22,101,52,.15);border-color:rgba(22,101,52,.3);color:rgb(var(--status-green,22 101 52))}.ds-pending{background:rgba(146,64,14,.15);border-color:rgba(146,64,14,.3);color:rgb(var(--status-amber,146 64 14))}"
